{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d5e9dfab53762779835bf04522b2f22acea172986492af2e72de4f0cae7a5b0d","ja":"えへへ、ホンマに？","zh":"嘿嘿，真的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ca4275abe84fbb04b64543cee8bb59d1eea485c6127d56a0d452b32c820003fb","ja":"……って、いやいや！\nほめてもらえるのは、うれしいけど～！","zh":"……等等，不对不对！能得到夸奖我确实很开心啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"845aee24c75a9810d93e1e456c06443e5d5c436a41fb5def5a8f5749d43940e6","ja":"ふふ、演技の練習がんばったものね。おかげで、\nこのアトラクションもすごく臨場感あったわ。","zh":"呵呵，毕竟你努力练习了演技嘛。多亏了你，\n这个游乐项目也非常有临场感。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d0272dc5d2c6985d9b883e042c6bd7cd20c0eff8c703d9abbabbd0aeec3aa6ba","ja":"はい、すごく楽しめました！\nけど……。","zh":"是的，我玩得非常开心！\n不过……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"015ac1235cc15c089c9060160890680b4a19ac719168a3f1d4c90e9dd470ee52","ja":"やっぱり悔しいです！\n残りの問題も気になるし！","zh":"我还是很不甘心！\n剩下的问题也很让人在意！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ebbc0b38b327bd5c8ec90c9d31408ada99bce9f44604620cf6ca0997e4448056","ja":"うん！　たまき、もう1回脱出アトラクションしたい！\n次は村からちゃんと出たいぞ！","zh":"嗯！环，想再玩1次逃脱类游乐项目！  \n下次一定要好好从村子里出来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"05c2283b35d8014cef15882c7eee684facef827d85ac2e008973ff971872acee","ja":"そうね！　このまま帰るなんてできないわ！\nリベンジしましょ♪","zh":"没错！　怎么能就这样回去呢！\n我们来雪耻吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"381688b32410265d872458d139f149bcf4bf3a05fe327521c1b9bb5024dad171","ja":"2回目の挑戦……。","zh":"第2次挑战……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
