{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_998.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"0a62106fb75b42f7285f4f75777febbd8ba53c709538a202512b08741abed149","ja":"え、そうだったかしら……？\nあれ？　さっきって……いつ……？","zh":"诶，是这样吗……？\n咦？刚才……是什么时候……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
